  "description": "The Copperhead EVO HD 750 Wave is the most accessible eMTB in the BULLS lineup.\nThis high-performance electric mountain bike is designed for riders seeking both capability and approachability—whether you're tackling tough trails or cruising off-road paths.\nFeaturing a step-through frame and robust specs, this eMTB brings confidence to all types of riders, no matter their experience or physical condition.\n\nMotor and Battery\n\nMotor: Bosch Performance Line CX motor with 85 Nm of torque for strong acceleration and responsive support, perfect for trail and cross-country use.\n\nBattery: Bosch PowerTube 750 Wh, fully integrated into the downtube for sleek aesthetics. Approx. 6-hour charge time to full capacity.\n\nSuspension and Frame\n\nFork: SR Suntour Lytro 34 with 120mm of travel to smooth out uneven terrain.\n\nFrame: Lightweight and durable aluminum 6061 with internal cable routing. Available in frame sizes 41 / 44 / 48 cm for optimal fit.\n\nDrivetrain and Brakes\n\nGears: Shimano Deore 10-speed drivetrain for reliable shifting and a wide gear range.\n\nBrakes: Tektro HD-M530 hydraulic disc brakes (203mm front, 180mm rear) deliver strong and consistent stopping power, even on steep descents.\n\nWheels and Tires\n\nWheels: 27.5\" wheels offer a perfect balance of maneuverability and stability.\n\nTires: Schwalbe Smart Sam 2.6\" wide tires provide great traction and control across mixed terrain.\n\nAdditional Features\n\nRemote: BOSCH LED remote connects via Bluetooth to your phone and displays essential ride data like speed, battery level, and distance. Simple, intuitive, and easy to read while riding.\n\nPedals and Saddle: BULLS MTB pedals and Zecure MTB saddle ensure secure footing and comfort throughout your ride.\n\nTechnology and Design\n\nMonkeyLink Ready: Seamless accessory integration with MonkeyLink-compatible lights and fenders.\n\nClass-1 eBike: Pedal assist up to 20 mph, legal on most bike paths and trails.\n\nRide Experience\n\nAccessible adventure: Built to break barriers and welcome all riders—especially those new to mountain biking.\n\nConfidence meets comfort: Step-through design and upright geometry offer easy access and a secure, relaxed ride feel.\n\nFun on every trail: From dirt paths to weekend rides, this eMTB brings freedom, power, and pure riding joy to every adventure.",
